{"classification":"source-proof-logic-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0377","math_ordinal":240,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"This is the neighborhood witnessing membership in H; the authority's G contradicts the immediately paired G-neighborhood.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:264","source_normalized_sha256":"d49ac2431e6e29826dbd1312555aa13e5e860c6eb9c8c9fb30f44169cf073802","source_text":"U(x;\\rho'_0,\\ldots,\\rho'_n;\\delta')\\subseteq G","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:269","target_normalized_sha256":"639127a8990a3fa27c9e4910ce42e81b13e7949ea54ddbaed4f5882793c6d8b8","target_text":"U(x;\\rho'_0,\\ldots,\\rho'_n;\\delta')\\subseteq H","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-index-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0378","math_ordinal":342,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The condition is indexed by i; the proof selects rho_ij for each i, so theta_i is required.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:365","source_normalized_sha256":"d4d0157801c5d667b12d01aad51ed7cb338fee4968cd946f800d9f203aca136a","source_text":"\\theta(\\phi(y),\\phi(x))\\le\\bover12\\epsilon","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:372","target_normalized_sha256":"a349591b3c3b01090602a7ea3821d929282adfb661e71404e4ad251961659332","target_text":"\\theta_i(\\phi(y),\\phi(x))\\le\\bover12\\epsilon","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-neighborhood-syntax-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0379","math_ordinal":470,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The authority has an unmatched parenthesis and comma; the neighborhood notation must list rho_0 through rho_n inside one argument.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:497","source_normalized_sha256":"fb3f7f836936445b44a9d7bec3797b9f0810f366f55659a3f03a9356a8b9f0ae","source_text":"U(x;\\rho_0),\\ldots,\\rho_n;\\delta)\\subseteq G","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:505","target_normalized_sha256":"60d709e4629a009e1206cc3179c0ec56f677b82fa9b307e5cd5b8ee5732340cd","target_text":"U(x;\\rho_0,\\ldots,\\rho_n;\\delta)\\subseteq G","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-quantifier-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0380","math_ordinal":546,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The convergence proof is centered at x; requiring an open set containing X makes no sense and contradicts the following neighborhood construction.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:541","source_normalized_sha256":"4b68ab3847feda7d6c62c1fbcbeebfa35eab7351ed5e78f4ddadea5df64b8015","source_text":"an open set G containing X","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:554","target_normalized_sha256":"2d711642b726b04401627ca9fbac32f5c8530fb1903cc4db02258717921a4881","target_text":"himpunan terbuka G yang memuat x","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-set-union-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0381","math_ordinal":729,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The filter construction requires the union of the finite family of sets in Cal G_0, not the family symbol itself.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:704","source_normalized_sha256":"4d05985379a75bf5ec689bc96092e58ba9bf6490893bfc6039c3c5b5b79e8035","source_text":"F\\cup\\Cal G_0\\supseteq K","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:718","target_normalized_sha256":"bffb8ce3e08af93f9dec880c278102a250865344efe196d2b6ec87c497467750","target_text":"F\\cup\\bigcup\\Cal G_0\\supseteq K","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-index-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0382","math_ordinal":838,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The displayed preimage is the i-th pseudometric neighborhood, so the predicate must use theta_i.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:795","source_normalized_sha256":"696ac8232ef8ce045ff89b50edd70be1e493658949be24e2a9364ba79bd00001","source_text":"\\phi^{-1}[U(y;\\theta_i;\\epsilon)]=\\{x:\\theta(\\phi(x),y)<\\epsilon\\}","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:814","target_normalized_sha256":"cf5e7d809ddbed02f6765670a3f7b8efb7269f63368ab5c6efdcb1edb2a33075","target_text":"\\phi^{-1}[U(y;\\theta_i;\\epsilon)]=\\{x:\\theta_i(\\phi(x),y)<\\epsilon\\}","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-parentheses-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0383","math_ordinal":896,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The limsup inequality applies to the sum f(x)+g(x); the source omits the grouping parentheses.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:857","source_normalized_sha256":"84beb4638646f8cd00c08a46d78b4603f3b617d0f35d08bb66a788b6daa1c234","source_text":"\\limsup_{x\\to\\Cal F}f(x)+g(x)\\le\\limsup_{x\\to\\Cal F}f(x)+\\limsup_{x\\to\\Cal F}g(x)","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:876","target_normalized_sha256":"443fa2c6ae71387d5b92ddda5a9b50b595ad787c45ccfad17dcfc4549be51454","target_text":"\\limsup_{x\\to\\Cal F}(f(x)+g(x))\\le\\limsup_{x\\to\\Cal F}f(x)+\\limsup_{x\\to\\Cal F}g(x)","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-parentheses-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0384","math_ordinal":897,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The liminf inequality applies to the grouped sum f(x)+g(x); the source omits the grouping parentheses.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:860","source_normalized_sha256":"52389081b4763933049f5f57988f77f80ff1365a3ce493022b7277afc14edce6","source_text":"\\liminf_{x\\to\\Cal F}f(x)+g(x)\\ge\\liminf_{x\\to\\Cal F}f(x)+\\liminf_{x\\to\\Cal F}g(x)","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:879","target_normalized_sha256":"18d5cd114585f7e7bece09cef34ae6202f13cee50125b807c6ad2f1e6a787ca1","target_text":"\\liminf_{x\\to\\Cal F}(f(x)+g(x))\\ge\\liminf_{x\\to\\Cal F}f(x)+\\liminf_{x\\to\\Cal F}g(x)","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-variable-omission","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0385","math_ordinal":905,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The preceding sentence introduces b as the limit of g; the authority drops g(x) inside the limit.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:871","source_normalized_sha256":"0219cd9010c9415be10b419df7268c56fef6b6b89a9975810db0c8447deb2dcf","source_text":"b=\\lim_{x\\to\\Cal F}(x)","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:890","target_normalized_sha256":"6633dcdacb353a19bfdb00ff80a734ad6fe6c49f77ac959cc6b9ce53e8d5d6a0","target_text":"b=\\lim_{x\\to\\Cal F}g(x)","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-parentheses-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0386","math_ordinal":907,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The limit of the sum must group f(x)+g(x); without parentheses the displayed expression is ambiguous and does not state the claimed identity.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:871","source_normalized_sha256":"21b5a9a9b6d20dbeea55433f9deb352b3250e1283dd5d08652c86524c4945105","source_text":"\\lim_{x\\to\\Cal F}f(x)+g(x)","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:891","target_normalized_sha256":"6cc28411fe2d9db5f8f9b0776b24737fa0fc52abdc458c0fe5bee53782240aab","target_text":"\\lim_{x\\to\\Cal F}(f(x)+g(x))","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-center-radius-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0387","math_ordinal":1010,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"This neighborhood is in the Y-space around y and uses the separately chosen delta'; the authority repeats x and delta.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:955","source_normalized_sha256":"d7fed8a237127039017eac7b8ef2a56266e25275b101058d69bb206ccb58bc05","source_text":"U(x;\\theta_0,\\ldots,\\theta_n;\\delta)\\subseteq H","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:975","target_normalized_sha256":"b37184b366581cc8fafb221e81667555d50708fb7a55fab35790d1f2a5c9551a","target_text":"U(y;\\theta_0,\\ldots,\\theta_n;\\delta')\\subseteq H","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-index-notation-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0388","math_ordinal":1026,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The product pseudometric induced by rho_m is tilde rho_m; the authority drops the tilde in the equality.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:974","source_normalized_sha256":"077d10213caeea2f2d435494f643f7a687953234a1d04ef050414b93b0fe5f5c","source_text":"(x,y)\\in G\\times H=U((x,y);\\tilde\\rho_0,\\ldots,\\rho_m,\\bar\\theta_0,\\ldots,\\bar\\theta_n;\\delta)","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:994","target_normalized_sha256":"902046186355487c3464dbd2101c44a96eb1fd92e6682aa2e86ee382514fc823","target_text":"(x,y)\\in G\\times H=U((x,y);\\tilde\\rho_0,\\ldots,\\tilde\\rho_m,\\bar\\theta_0,\\ldots,\\bar\\theta_n;\\delta)","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
{"classification":"source-vector-difference-typo","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0389","math_ordinal":1044,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-COMPLETE-CORPUS-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The difference of product vectors is (x,y)-(x',y'); the authority's (x-y) is dimensionally malformed.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt2a3.tex:995","source_normalized_sha256":"9038b9e23b97bfa38a01b7f32e33638c075fa920bd691dea240674ed45104050","source_text":"\\rho((x,y),(x',y'))=\\|(x-y)-(x',y')\\|","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt2a3.tex:1015","target_normalized_sha256":"3b63eb7d29fa6fec77e7ff27ed07236ade74952677611ba4f427d05c80e41fc6","target_text":"\\rho((x,y),(x',y'))=\\|(x,y)-(x',y')\\|","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-APP-2A3"}
